{"id":"wb-7-99","name":"冮官屯窑址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"冮官窑","text":"冮官窑为辽代民窑，位于今辽宁省辽阳市文圣区小屯镇。该窑烧制器种繁多，初建于辽，金代达全盛，元代渐衰至废。1988年冮官屯窑址被列入辽宁省重点文物保护单位并于2013年列入全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%86%AE%E5%AE%98%E7%AA%91","revisionId":94152058,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94152058","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名称、所在地与对应遗址；原名录行政地址及参考点位不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0b2d35ad6c93865f6ae365b5.jpg","title":"冮官窑-（辽阳博）4.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%86%AE%E5%AE%98%E7%AA%91-%EF%BC%88%E8%BE%BD%E9%98%B3%E5%8D%9A%EF%BC%894.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/%E5%86%AE%E5%AE%98%E7%AA%91-%EF%BC%88%E8%BE%BD%E9%98%B3%E5%8D%9A%EF%BC%894.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"红烧腰果","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​辽阳博物馆复原的冮官窑烧窑场景","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"冮官窑"}}